# .understandignore — scoped to "repo operations"
# Strategy: ignore everything, then allowlist the operational backbone:
#   - .local/scripts  (bootstrap/provisioning + helper scripts)
#   - .github         (CI workflows + dependabot)
#   - root build/docs (Makefile, README.md, AGENTS.md, SECURITY.md)
# Uses gitignore semantics (the `ignore` package): un-ignore parent dirs,
# re-exclude their other children, then re-include the wanted subtree.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# --- Root build & docs ---
!Makefile
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!SECURITY.md

# --- CI / GitHub ---
!.github/
!.github/**

# --- Automation scripts ---
!.local/
.local/*
!.local/scripts/
!.local/scripts/**
